  "prefLabel": "Hab 102.01 Accident, mistake, or misfortune",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hab 102.01 “Accident, mistake, or misfortune” means something outside the party’s own control and not due to neglect, or something that reasonably prudent person would not be expected to guard against or provide for.\n\nSource. #13226 eff 7-7-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hab100-300.html"
